SAFETY DISCLAIMER & PROTOTYPE NOTICE:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ElectroGuard is an academic and educational prototype developed for a
social-impact hackathon. It does not replace physical electrical isolation,
approved mechanical Lockout/Tagout (LOTO) procedures, portable grounding
rods, or certified utility permit-to-work (PTW) protocols. It must never be
connected directly to high-voltage mains electricity or distribution grids.
